        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attrition</strong> is a tactical 4-player PvP card game of survival and sabotage, where every move counts — build deadly combos, outmaneuver your opponents, and be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a gamble — play offensively to deal damage, or hold back and defend against incoming attacks. Timing, resource management, and reading your opponents are key to surviving the chaos. With each card played, the battlefield shifts, forcing you to adapt your tactics or face total elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online  with friends in fast-paced matches designed for both casual players and competitive strategists. No two games are the same — every round tells a different story of betrayal, comeback victories, and perfectly timed plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outsmart the competition or fall to Attrition?</p>",
